      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deep Dive",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deep Dive",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "L9aody2ToIOJUIyUvjU-Y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8316.920727291112,
      "y": 9136.912062187652,
      "width": 1953.0712890625,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b23",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 269983347,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 254228115,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783422062238,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1)  The system should render photos and videos instantly, supporting photos up to 8mb and videos up to 4GB",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1)  The system should render photos and videos instantly, supporting photos up to 8mb and videos up to 4GB",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-5jQq6N9YCaPk3x7h_vgK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8144.0323561877685,
      "y": 9459.188028736715,
      "width": 786.2757568359375,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b24",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1133230963,
      "version": 27,
      "versionNonce": 285084317,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783422081544,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "There are two main ways to handle the post\nmetadata update after upload completion:",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "There are two main ways to handle the post metadata update after upload completion:",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7CPp_O_yKGGXDS2PgkEIP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8156.056404039331,
      "y": 9491.688028736715,
      "width": 762.2276611328125,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b25",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1488333117,
      "version": 27,
      "versionNonce": 229849523,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783422081544,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Client-driven approach: The client sends a\nPATCH request to update the post\nmetadata with the S3 object_key and sets\nthe media upload status to complete once\nthe multipart upload finishes.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Client-driven approach: The client sends a PATCH request to update the post metadata with the S3 object_key and sets the media upload status to complete once the multipart upload finishes.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hPEELuhVZW0ToQClg5Yc0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8165.020362779565,
      "y": 9726.688028736715,
      "width": 744.2997436523438,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b26",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1409930515,
      "version": 27,
      "versionNonce": 1165799165,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783422081544,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Server-driven approach: We configure S3\nevent notifications to trigger a Lambda\nfunction or background job when the\nmultipart upload completes. This job then\nupdates the post metadata automatically.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Server-driven approach: We configure S3 event notifications to trigger a Lambda function or background job when the multipart upload completes. This job then updates the post metadata automatically.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "nKbNgj9DqFEV-lQyv2OFb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8344.887374443575,
      "y": 9219.272148152333,
      "width": 2097.479689830726,
      "height": 405,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b27",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 291547379,
      "version": 140,
      "versionNonce": 352835987,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783422145990,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "There are two main ways to handle the post metadata update after upload completion:\n\nClient-driven approach: \n1) The client sends a PATCH request to update the post metadata with the S3 object_key and sets the media upload\nstatus to complete once the multipart upload finishes.\n\n2) Server-driven approach: \nWe configure S3 event notifications to trigger a Lambda function or background job when the multipart upload\ncompletes. This job then updates the post metadata automatically.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "There are two main ways to handle the post metadata update after upload completion:\n\nClient-driven approach: \n1) The client sends a PATCH request to update the post metadata with the S3 object_key and sets the media upload status to complete once the multipart upload finishes.\n\n2) Server-driven approach: \nWe configure S3 event notifications to trigger a Lambda function or background job when the multipart upload completes. This job then updates the post metadata automatically.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Y_JnsQEvsimFg1iJFtS82",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8339.063890220505,
      "y": 9705.541566476046,
      "width": 1180.0076904296875,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b28",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1325463571,
      "version": 29,
      "versionNonce": 499204947,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783422196487,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now, how we get it to render quickly when a user views the image ?\n\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now, how we get it to render quickly when a user views the image ?\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wbV28BQJVbXgbZcD8bSIS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8355.008120819404,
      "y": 9779.294445087227,
      "width": 2044.439697265625,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b29",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 80026653,
      "version": 68,
      "versionNonce": 2094091613,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783422219985,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- The most effective solution combines CDN distribution with dynamic media optimization. \n   When media is uploaded, we use a media processing service (like Cloudinary or Imgix) to generate multiple variants \n   optimized for different devices and network conditions",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- The most effective solution combines CDN distribution with dynamic media optimization. \n   When media is uploaded, we use a media processing service (like Cloudinary or Imgix) to generate multiple variants \n   optimized for different devices and network conditions",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "G-l1gwmlC4xyBOY1q63hL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8326.762133037508,
      "y": 10034.940336546362,
      "width": 997.7037353515625,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 609564381,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 1309035709,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783422254693,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2) The system should be scalable to support 500M DAU",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2) The system should be scalable to support 500M DAU",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rXMeUnEXl1emzhQVqajmM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8412.576500136702,
      "y": 10079.812918020885,
      "width": 1873.0797119140625,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 493930515,
      "version": 56,
      "versionNonce": 239094461,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783422408003,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Precomputed Feeds\n- CDN\n- Chunked Uploads: chunking uploads improves reliability and user experience, and allows for parallel uploads\n- DB (DynamoDB) : provides horizontal scalability for metadata storage",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Precomputed Feeds\n- CDN\n- Chunked Uploads: chunking uploads improves reliability and user experience, and allows for parallel uploads\n- DB (DynamoDB) : provides horizontal scalability for metadata storage",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7b-ZBPHmbvN9eplGXCn3I",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6227.073229099473,
      "y": 8791.396068058035,
      "width": 3147.082275390625,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1849261245,
      "version": 191,
      "versionNonce": 1897764467,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783422484581,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "It has a lot of similarities with our breakdowns of FB News Feed and Dropbox, refer FB News Feed for Precomputed Feeds and Follow and Dropbox for Media (Chunked Uploads).",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "It has a lot of similarities with our breakdowns of FB News Feed and Dropbox, refer FB News Feed for Precomputed Feeds and Follow and Dropbox for Media (Chunked Uploads).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
